<title>USA: In Home Health names Thomas Gross as CFO.</title>
<headline>In Home Health names Thomas Gross as CFO.</headline>
<dateline>MINNETONKA, Minn. 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>In Home Health Inc said Wednesday that Controller Thomas Gross had been named to the added position of chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Gross will fill a vacancy created in October with the resignation of Ken Figge.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
